  ('dead-sea-jordan', '04A', 'Dead Sea', 'Jordan', 'Float on the lowest water on Earth, then let', 'live', 'verified', 'spaWellness', 'Jordan & the Levant', '{"wellness","ultra"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","ultra"}', null, 'core', '{"key_facts":["The lowest point on Earth - roughly 430 m (about 1,410 ft) below sea level","Hypersaline (about 10x the ocean) - you float effortlessly; the black mineral mud is a wellness ritual","A luxury spa-resort strip along the western shore, about 1 hour from Amman","The gentle third leg - pairs with Petra + Wadi Rum for the full Jordan loop","US Level 3 Reconsider Travel (March 2026); the Level-4 areas are the Syria/Iraq borders - the Dead Sea is in the west, far from them","Mild in winter (a wellness/sun window); very hot in summer"],"safety":{"emergency":"911 (unified - police / ambulance / civil defense); Tourist Police +962 79 550 5755","hospital":"Amman (~1 hr) for major referral; carry travel-medical + evac insurance","advisory_level":"L3","activity_note":"L3 Reconsider Travel - disclose prominently. Level-4 areas = Syria/Iraq borders (far north/east); the Dead Sea resort strip is in the west, far from them. Float safety: never submerge/get salt in eyes, no shaving beforehand, rinse in fresh water, short early floats; heart/BP conditions check first. Summer heat at the lowest point on Earth - hydrate.","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 3km of the border with Syria."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to Syria."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to Iraq ."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to the provinces in Iraq bordering Jordan."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel Aqaba Governate FCDO advises against all but essential travel to Aqaba international airport and seaport."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to Aqaba international airport and seaport."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/jordan","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-07-22T13:47:55+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Mar-May & Sep-Nov (warm, comfortable)","shoulder":"Dec-Feb (mild winter sun - a wellness/spa value season)","green":"Jun-Aug (very hot - pool/spa + early/late shore)","booking_lead":"luxury resort spas 1-3 mo; peak spring/autumn earlier","off_season_specials":"winter-wellness value when Europe is cold; pair with Petra + Wadi Rum + Amman","event_peaks":"spring + autumn peak; winter-sun wellness window","campaign_start":"sell spring/autumn + winter-wellness 2-3 mo out; lead EN + GCC + DE; float + spa + winter-sun angles"},"jewels":[{"name":"A luxury resort-spa float + mineral-mud ritual","si_tag":"wellness","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"within the stay","timing":"year-round; winter-mild","draw_rank":1,"hook":"effortless float on the lowest water on Earth, then a full spa day on the shore","si":"wellness","blurb":"effortless float on the lowest water on Earth, then a full spa day on the shore","when":"year-round; winter-mild","commission":"resort/DMC 10-16%"},{"name":"A winter-sun wellness stay","si_tag":"wellness","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"within the stay","timing":"Dec-Feb","draw_rank":2,"hook":"the Dead Sea is mild in winter — a quiet, value wellness window when Europe is cold","si":"wellness","blurb":"the Dead Sea is mild in winter — a quiet, value wellness window when Europe is cold","when":"Dec-Feb","commission":"resort/DMC"},{"name":"A shore-front luxury wellness suite + private spa program","si_tag":"ultra","status":"live","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application","timing":"year-round","draw_rank":1,"timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"a resort suite over the lowest water on Earth, a bespoke spa/mud program, and Petra + Wadi Rum an easy drive away. Earning: consortia/DMC","si":"ultra","blurb":"a resort suite over the lowest water on Earth, a bespoke spa/mud program, and Petra + Wadi Rum an easy drive away. Earning: consortia/DMC","when":"year-round","commission":"consortia/DMC"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the Dead Sea?","a":"The lowest point on Earth - a hypersaline lake about 430 m below sea level where you float without effort. The mineral mud is a spa ritual, and a strip of luxury wellness resorts lines the western shore about an hour from Amman.","source":"geographic references","si_tag":"wellness"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit the Dead Sea?","a":"Spring (Mar-May) and autumn (Sep-Nov) are ideal. It''s mild in winter - a good winter-sun and wellness window when Europe is cold - and very hot in summer, when you tour the shore early and late and lean on the pool and spa.","source":"tourism references","si_tag":"wellness"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Dead Sea Jordan Guide: Float, Spa Resorts & Safety - Best Time to Visit (2026)","meta_description":"Plan the Dead Sea in Jordan - float on the lowest point on Earth, mineral-mud spa resorts, a mild winter-wellness window, an hour from Amman, with straight Level-3 safety intel.","slug":"dead-sea-jordan","primary_keyword":"Dead Sea Jordan","long_tail":["Dead Sea float","Dead Sea spa resort","is the Dead Sea safe","lowest point on Earth","Dead Sea winter","Dead Sea mud"],"search_language":"en","local_keywords":["Dead Sea","Sweimeh","lowest point on Earth","mineral mud"],"hreflang":["en","ar","de"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-08-03"},"booking":{"bin":"book_with_disclosure","level":"L3","codes":["reconsider-travel","regional-tensions","terrorism"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"Jordan US Level 3 Reconsider Travel (escalated March 2026, regional US-Iran tensions). Disclose PROMINENTLY; heightened-consent booking. Level-4 Do-Not-Travel areas = Syria + Iraq border strips + Manshe