estart targeted for January 2027, and Gulf airports generally are open but subject to short-notice closures. Confirm every segment close to departure and expect routing changes.","source":"supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What would a Doha trip cover once bookable again?","a":"The Museum of Islamic Art and its park, Souq Waqif in the evening, the National Museum of Qatar, a Corniche walk with the dhow harbour, Katara Cultural Village, The Pearl and Msheireb Downtown, Education City (Qatar National Library, Mathaf), and a Khor Al Adaid inland-sea desert safari.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit Doha?","a":"November-March is the cool, dry season; summer is extreme (above 40C with high humidity). Planning-only guidance while the destination is held content-only.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Is there anything specific to know about safety in the city itself?","a":"Beyond the regional conflict and the flight disruption, Doha''s own street-crime level is low; the binding constraints right now are the Level 3 advisory, the flight risk, and the content-only hold. Re-verify the advisory before acting on anything here.","source":"levels supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read; en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Doha Travel Advisory & Guide (Qatar): Level 3, Safety","meta_description":"Doha under a U.S. Level 3 advisory amid the 2026 Gulf conflict - the safety picture, the Philadelphia-Doha flight cut, and the sights for when travel resumes. Held content-only.","slug":"doha-qatar","primary_keyword":"Doha travel advisory 2026","long_tail":["Doha Level 3 Reconsider Travel","Qatar safety 2026","Philadelphia Doha flight cancelled","Museum of Islamic Art","Souq Waqif"],"search_language":"ar (restated, not machine-translated)","l