  ('merzouga-morocco', '04A', 'Merzouga & the Sahara', 'Morocco', 'A camel at dawn, a luxury camp in the', 'live', 'verified', 'desertDunes', 'Morocco', '{"adventure","culture","ultra"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'anchor', '{"key_facts":["The great dunes - Erg Chebbi (Merzouga, accessible, iconic tall dunes) and Erg Chigaga (near M''Hamid, remoter, wilder, 4x4-access)","Luxury desert camps - en-suite dome tents, camel treks, hosted dining, bivouacs; ~EUR290-460/night (Erg Chebbi), ~GBP320/night (Erg Chigaga Nubia camp)","The classic overland from Marrakech (3-6 days) - Tizi n''Tichka pass, Ait Benhaddou (UNESCO kasbah), Ouarzazate, Dades + Todra gorges, then camel to camp","US L2 Exercise Increased Caution (Apr 2025) - dunes + overland are mainstream tourism; only Do-Not-Travel area is the remote Western-Sahara Berm, far south","Sold via Morocco DMCs + desert-camp operators ~10-16%; remote - evacuation insurance essential","Best season Oct-Apr (mild days, cold nights); avoid Jun-Aug 40C+. NEW Desert & Camel Caravans SI not live yet - rides on globaladv+ultra, re-tag to desert when live"],"safety":{"emergency":"19 police (urban) / 177 gendarmerie (rural) / 15 ambulance","hospital":"Remote - nearest hospitals Errachidia/Ouarzazate; carry travel-medical + EVACUATION insurance","advisory_level":"L2","activity_note":"L2 disclose - dunes + overland are mainstream tourism (Do-Not-Travel Western-Sahara Berm is far south). Extreme summer heat Jun-Aug 40C+ (go Oct-Apr). Remote - evacuation insurance essential. Camel/4x4 with licensed operators; desert nights cold - layers.","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/morocco","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-19T12:00:36+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Oct-Apr (mild days, starry nights); Christmas/NY high","shoulder":"May + Sep","green":"Jun-Aug (40C+ - dangerous heat)","booking_lead":"luxury camps + overland loops 2-5 mo for Oct-Apr; ultra dome-tents sell out at peak","off_season_specials":"shoulder value; pair with Marrakech + Fez in one loop","event_peaks":"Oct-Apr; Christmas/NY; European holidays","campaign_start":"sell Oct-Apr desert loops 3-5 mo out; lead FR + EN; stargazing/luxury-camp angle"},"jewels":[{"name":"A camel trek into Erg Chebbi at sunset","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"within the loop","timing":"Oct-Apr; sunset","draw_rank":1,"hook":"ride the last dune as the sand turns to fire, then a luxury camp and a Berber fire under the stars","si":"adventure","blurb":"ride the last dune as the sand turns to fire, then a luxury camp and a Berber fire under the stars","when":"Oct-Apr; sunset","commission":"DMC/camp 10-15%"},{"name":"The overland run - Ait Benhaddou + the Dades/Todra gorges","si_tag":"culture","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"within the loop","timing":"Oct-Apr","draw_rank":2,"hook":"the High Atlas pass, the UNESCO kasbah, the Dades and Todra gorges","si":"culture","blurb":"the High Atlas pass, the UNESCO kasbah, the Dades and Todra gorges","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"DMC 10-16%"},{"name":"A luxury dome-tent camp on Erg Chebbi","si_tag":"ultra","status":"live","tier":"luxury","price_band":"~EUR290-460/night","timing":"Oct-Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"en-suite desert suites, private dining, stargazing — the Sahara without roughing it","si":"ultra","blurb":"en-suite desert suites, private dining, stargazing — the Sahara without roughing it","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"consortia/direct"},{"name":"A private Erg Chigaga camp + private astronomer","si_tag":"ultra","status":"future","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application","timing":"Oct-Apr","draw_rank":2,"hook":"the remote dune sea, an exclusive luxury camp, a guided night sky. Earning: DMC/consortia. MoR: commissionable","si":"ultra","blurb":"the remote dune sea, an exclusive luxury camp, a guided night sky. Earning: DMC/consortia. MoR: commissionable","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"DMC/consortia"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit the Moroccan desert?","a":"October to April - warm days and crisp, starry nights. June to August is dangerously hot (40C+), so avoid high summer.","source":"operator consensus","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"How do I get to Merzouga?","a":"The classic overland from Marrakech (3-6 days) - over the Tizi n''Tichka pass to Ait Benhaddou, through the Dades and Todra gorges, then a camel trek into the dunes to your camp. Fez is the shorter alternative bookend.","source":"kimkim.com","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"What are the luxury desert camps like?","a":"En-suite dome tents with real beds and bathrooms, hosted dining, camel treks and stargazing - the Sahara without roughing it. Rates run about EUR290-460/night at Erg Chebbi and around GBP320 at Erg Chigaga''s Nubia camp.","source":"ergchebbicamp.com","si_tag":"ultra"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Merzouga & the Sahara Guide: Erg Chebbi Dunes, Luxury Camps & the Overland Route","meta_description":"Plan the Moroccan Sahara - Erg Chebbi and Erg Chigaga dunes, luxury desert camps, camel treks, and the overland route from Marrakech (Ait Benhaddou, Dades, Todra), best season Oct-Apr, with real safety and timing intel.","slug":"merzouga-morocco","primary_keyword":"Merzouga Sahara Morocco","long_tail":["Erg Chebbi luxury camp","Merzouga camel trek","Marrakech to Sahara tour","Erg Chigaga","best time Moroccan desert","is the Moroccan Sahara safe"],"search_language":"fr","local_keywords":["Merzouga","Erg Chebbi","Sahara","Ait Benhaddou","dunes"],"hreflang":["en","fr","es"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-08-03"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L2","codes":["exercise-increased-caution","terrorism","crime"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"Morocco US L2 Exercise Increased Caution (Apr 2025) - same tier as France/Spain/Italy/UK. The dunes + overland route are mainstream tourism. The only Do-Not-Travel area is the remote Western-Sahara Berm (landmines), far to the south. Remote desert - carry evacuation insurance. Disclose L2. Re-verify each cycle."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-03","hits":3,"misses":17,"disregarded":3,"note":"Desert headline: globaladv (camel/dunes/4x4, maps to adventure) + culture (Berber/kasbahs) + ultra (luxury camps) live; romance + wellness future. sub_region ''Morocco & the Sahara'' PROPOSED - awaiting Sana nod. NEW ''Desert & Camel Caravans'' SI not live yet - rides on globaladv+ultra now, re-tag to ''desert'' when live (trivial)."},"sis_present":[{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live","note":"camel treks, Erg Chebbi/Chigaga dunes, 4x4, sandboarding; re-tags to desert when live"},{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"live","note":"Berber culture, Ait Benhaddou kasbah, Dades/Todra gorges"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live","note":"luxury dome-tent desert camps"}],"ultra":[{"name":"A private Erg Chigaga camp + 4x4 + private astronomer","why_ultra":"the remote dune sea, an exclusive luxury camp, a guided night sky","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application (re-tags to Desert & Camel Caravans SI when live)"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-03","hero":{"query":"Merzouga & the Sahara, Morocco"},"geo":{"lat":31.0801,"lng":-4.0133}}'::jsonb, 13),
