 at close range - stay in the vehicle, follow the guide. Crossings: 3,000+ crocodiles + panicked herds - designated vantage points only, never approach on foot. Conservancy walking with armed guide only. Remote - carry AMREF evac + insurance","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to: Mandera County Tarbaj and Wajir East constituencies in Wajir County, except for Wajir Town areas of Wajir County within 60km of Kenya’s border with Somalia Garissa County - except for Garissa Town, the constituency of Lagdera and the areas of Balambala constituency which lie north and west of the main road which runs from Saka on the Tana River up to the intersection with the C81 Road Lamu County, except for Lamu Island and Manda Island FCDO advises against all but essential travel to: Garissa Town Tana River County north of the Tana River as far as the town of Saka within 15km of the east coast between the Tana River and the Galana (Athi-Galana-Sabaki) River Find out more about why FCDO advises against travel ."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to: Mandera County Tarbaj and Wajir East constituencies in Wajir County, except for Wajir Town areas of Wajir County within 60km of Kenya’s border with Somalia Garissa County - except for Garissa Town, the constituency of Lagdera and the areas of Balambala constituency which lie north and west of the main road which runs from Saka on the Tana River up to the intersection with the C81 Road Lamu County, except for Lamu Island and Manda Island FCDO advises against all but essential travel to: Garissa Town Tana River County north of the Tana River as far as the town of Saka within 15km of the east coast between the Tana River and the Galana (Athi-Galana-Sabaki) River There have been frequent attacks in the north-eastern border regions, most of which were attributed to Al Shabaab."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to: Garissa Town Tana River County north of the Tana River as far as the town of Saka within 15km of the east coast between the Tana River and the Galana (Athi-Galana-Sabaki) River Find out more about why FCDO advises against travel ."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to: Garissa Town Tana River County north of the Tana River as far as the town of Saka within 15km of the east coast between the Tana River and the Galana (Athi-Galana-Sabaki) River There have been frequent attacks in the north-eastern border regions, most of which were attributed to Al Shabaab."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/kenya","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-06-24T12:48:44+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Jul-Oct (Great Migration + Mara River crossings, Aug-Sep drama); secondary Jan-Mar (green + big cats)","shoulder":"Jun (herds arriving) + Nov (short rains, return crossings)","green":"Apr-May (long rains - lush, quiet, cheapest)","booking_lead":"6-12 mo for Jul-Oct peak (reserve + conservancy camps sell out); mid-range 3-6 mo; green 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Apr-May green-season value + Jan-Mar big-cat season (no migration crush); conservancy walking/night-drive packages year-round","event_peaks":"Jul-Oct crossing crush + Christmas/NY + Easter; N-Hemisphere summer","campaign_start":"Jul-Oct crossings 9-12 mo out (by prior Oct-Dec); Jan-Mar big-cat season by prior Sep-Nov; green-season value by prior Nov-Dec"},"jewels":[{"name":"The Mara River crossings","si_tag":"safari","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$1,000-2,500/pp/day","timing":"Jul-Oct; book 9-12 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"3,000+ crocodiles + panicked herds — keep to designated vantage points, never approach the bank on foot","si":"safari","blurb":"3,000+ crocodiles + panicked herds — keep to designated vantage points, never approach the bank on foot","when":"Jul-Oct; book 9-12 mo","commission":"safari DMC 15-25%"}