or big cats?","a":"For the Great Migration and Mara River crossings, come Jul-Oct (peak Aug-Sep). For big cats without the migration crush, come Jan-Mar. The long rains (Apr-May) are lush, quiet and cheapest. Book 6-12 months ahead for the Jul-Oct peak.","source":"dumaexplorer.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Reserve or a conservancy - what''s the difference?","a":"The National Reserve has the classic crossings but more vehicles; the surrounding conservancies (community/private land) offer fewer vehicles, walking safaris, off-road and night drives - the more exclusive, often ultra, choice. Many itineraries combine both.","source":"masaimarareserve.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"How much does a Maasai Mara safari cost?","a":"Reserve entry is $200/pp/day (2026 peak); a mid-range 4-day Mara safari runs ~$1,400-2,500/pp including the domestic flight, and a luxury 4-night peak stay $3,450-7,800/pp depending on camp.","source":"dumaexplorer.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Do I need a visa or yellow-fever certificate for Kenya?","a":"An eTA (Kenya replaced visas with the eTA in 2024 - apply at least 2 weeks ahead; required for all visitors). Yellow fever is compulsory only if you arrive from a YF-risk country (cert valid 10 days post-injection); CDC recommends the vaccine for most.","source":"en.wikipedia.org","si_tag":"safari"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Maasai Mara Safari Guide: Great Migration, Big Cats, Conservancies, Cost & Best Time","meta_description":"Plan a Maasai Mara safari - the densest big-cat country in Africa and the Great Migration''s climax: the Mara River crossings (Jul-Oct), reserve vs conservancy (walking, off-road, night drives), dawn balloon flights, 2026 fees and cost, with real safety, timing and evac intel.","slug":"maasai-mara-kenya","primary_keyword":"Maasai Mara safari","long_tail":["Maasai Mara Great Migration 2026","Mara River crossings best time","Maasai Mara conservancies vs reserve","Maasai Mara big cats","Maasai Mara safari cost","is the Maasai Mara safe","Mara balloon safari"],"search_language":"sw","local_keywords":["Maasai Mara","Uhamiaji Mkubwa","Mto Mara","simba","duma","chui","Wamaasai","safari ya puto"],"hreflang":["en","sw"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-31"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L2","codes":["exercise-increased-caution","crime","urban-unrest"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"Kenya US L2 Exercise Increased Caution - elevated risk in Nairobi/urban areas (crime, demonstrations) where tourists are rarely targeted; the Mara is a well-run licensed-operator safari. Disclose L2. Re-verify each cycle."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":7,"misses":15,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; SAFARI is the launch/demo SI - primary safari not globaladv; balloon + conservancy walking/night drives = globaladv; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","name":"safari","status":"live"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live","note":"balloon + conservancy walking/night drives"},{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"future","note":"Maasai"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Angama Mara - the escarpment apex","why_ultra":"glass-fronted tented suites 300m above the Mara Triangle, private guiding, the migration below - a Virtuoso value-add stay","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$1,500-3,000+/night"},{"name":"A private conservancy mobile camp + private guide + balloon","why_ultra":"exclusive-use conservancy camp, private vehicle/guide with walking + night drives, the dawn balloon","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"},{"name":"A Mara + Serengeti cross-border migration week (private-guided)","why_ultra":"follow the herds across the ecosystem, Kenya + Tanzania luxury camps, private guiding (mind the YF-transit rule)","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-31","hero":{"query":"Maasai Mara National Reserve, Kenya"},"geo":{"lat":-1.5,"lng":35.15}}'::jsonb, 0)
